  "adaptations": [
    "The standard manager owns identity, clone, initialization, public clocks, ordinary PluginReload and plugin data namespaces. Each callback receives its own SDK authorization.",
    "Station candidate materials stay in the host and use an invocation-bound opaque token. The host owns downloader destination authorization and durable exact-hash receipts for destructive operations. Legacy installed download rows are outside this fresh-use receipt proof.",
